  Scenario: Shipment from an unauthorized courier is not eligible                                          # features/cvls_eligibility.feature:20
    Given a shipment imported by courier "05" with value 3000 at office "0504" with tariff "4901.99.00.91" # features/steps/customs_steps.py:134
