  Scenario: Shipment with several failures lists every reason                                              # features/cvls_eligibility.feature:39
    Given a shipment imported by courier "05" with value 4000 at office "0469" with tariff "4901.99.00.91" # features/steps/customs_steps.py:134
    When the shipment eligibility is evaluated                                                             # features/steps/customs_steps.py:188
