  Scenario: Clearing the prohibited flag makes the shipment eligible again                                 # features/cvls_eligibility.feature:52
    Given a shipment imported by courier "04" with value 3000 at office "0504" with tariff "4901.99.00.91" # features/steps/customs_steps.py:134
