Feature: Importer matching # features/importer_matching.feature:1

  Scenario: Shipment with a matching customer gets an importer party  # features/importer_matching.feature:3
    Given a shipment message for account 451000001 with value 2500    # features/steps/customs_steps.py:143
    When the message is delivered to topic isdc                       # features/steps/customs_steps.py:159
    Then the shipment has an importer party for "ACME IMPORTS INC"    # features/steps/customs_steps.py:272

  Scenario: Shipment with no matching customer gets no importer party     # features/importer_matching.feature:8
    Given a shipment message for account 999000099 with value 2500        # features/steps/customs_steps.py:143
    When the message is delivered to topic isdc                           # features/steps/customs_steps.py:159
    Then the shipment has no importer party                               # features/steps/customs_steps.py:279
    And the shipment is persisted with 1 piece, 2 parties and 1 commodity # features/steps/customs_steps.py:230

Feature: Subscribe to Kafka and persist shipments # features/subscribe_to_kafka_and_persist_shipments.feature:1

  Scenario: Shipment message is delivered and the shipment graph is persisted  # features/subscribe_to_kafka_and_persist_shipments.feature:3
    Given a shipment message for account 451000001 with value 2500             # features/steps/customs_steps.py:143
    When the message is delivered to topic isdc                                # features/steps/customs_steps.py:159
    Then the shipment is persisted with 1 piece, 3 parties and 1 commodity     # features/steps/customs_steps.py:230
    And the message blob is marked processed                                   # features/steps/customs_steps.py:240

  Scenario: Replay of the same message replaces the shipment graph         # features/subscribe_to_kafka_and_persist_shipments.feature:9
    Given a shipment message for account 451000001 with value 2500         # features/steps/customs_steps.py:143
    When the message is delivered to topic isdc                            # features/steps/customs_steps.py:159
    And the same message is delivered to topic isdc again                  # features/steps/customs_steps.py:164
    Then the shipment is persisted with 1 piece, 3 parties and 1 commodity # features/steps/customs_steps.py:230
    And there are 2 message blobs for the shipment                         # features/steps/customs_steps.py:246

  Scenario: Replayed message with a changed value replaces the stored shipment  # features/subscribe_to_kafka_and_persist_shipments.feature:16
    Given a shipment message for account 451000001 with value 2500              # features/steps/customs_steps.py:143
    When the message is delivered to topic isdc                                 # features/steps/customs_steps.py:159
    And the message is delivered again with value 3100                          # features/steps/customs_steps.py:170
    Then the shipment is persisted with 1 piece, 3 parties and 1 commodity      # features/steps/customs_steps.py:230
    And the stored shipment value is 3100                                       # features/steps/customs_steps.py:252

  Scenario: Deleting the shipment leaves no orphans                # features/subscribe_to_kafka_and_persist_shipments.feature:23
    Given a shipment message for account 451000001 with value 2500 # features/steps/customs_steps.py:143
    When the message is delivered to topic isdc                    # features/steps/customs_steps.py:159
    And the shipment is deleted                                    # features/steps/customs_steps.py:182
    Then no pieces, parties or commodities remain for the shipment # features/steps/customs_steps.py:258

  Scenario: A malformed message leaves an unprocessed blob with error text (live Kafka only)  # features/subscribe_to_kafka_and_persist_shipments.feature:29
    Given a malformed shipment message                                                        # features/steps/customs_steps.py:150
    When the malformed message is delivered live to topic isdc                                # features/steps/customs_steps.py:177
    Then the message blob is not processed and has error text                                 # features/steps/customs_steps.py:264

